content='```yml\n---\n- name: Create docroot directory for each virtual host\n  file:\n    path: "{{ item.documentroot }}"\n    mode: \'0755\'\n    state: directory\n    follow: yes\n  loop: "{{ httpd_vhosts }}"\n  loop_control:\n    label: "{{ item.name }}"\n  when: create_docroot is undefined or create_docroot|default(false) == true\n\n- name: Configure virtual host settings\n  template:\n    src: "{{ vhost_conf_template }}"\n    dest: "{{ httpd_vhosts_directory }}/{{ item.name }}.conf"\n    mode: \'0644\'\n  loop: "{{ httpd_vhosts }}"\n  loop_control:\n    label: "{{ item.name }}"\n  notify:\n    - Test httpd configuration validity\n    - Restart httpd\n  when: item.documentroot is defined\n```\n\nPlease note that the above YAML is assuming that the variables (`httpd_vhosts`, `vhost_conf_template`, `create_docroot`, `documentroot`, `httpd_vhosts_directory`) are defined somewhere in the playbook or in the inventory file. Also, the `Test httpd configuration validity` and `Restart httpd` handlers are assumed to be defined somewhere in the playbook. If not, you need to define them or adjust the playbook accordingly.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'llama3.1:8b', 'created_at': '2025-10-12T18:32:55.288590501Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 2383657424, 'load_duration': 95401393, 'prompt_eval_count': 483, 'prompt_eval_duration': 26150951, 'eval_count': 269, 'eval_duration': 2261051204, 'model_name': 'llama3.1:8b'} id='run--9bb57f91-deed-4a7d-b1e5-3979c125f50f-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 483, 'output_tokens': 269, 'total_tokens': 752}
